            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88559987?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Doc incorrectly stated that SharedWorker is accessible from dedicated Workers. This PR clarifies that this is not the case.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updating so people do not get confused, like I and some others had.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43098.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3927924135\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43098\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43098/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43098\">#43098</a> Status: Open.</p>",
